{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝眷顧以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華的話臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你去向耶路撒冷人的耳中喊叫說，耶和華如此說：",{"text":"你幼年的恩愛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"婚姻的愛情，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你怎樣在曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在未曾耕種之地跟隨我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我都記得。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時以色列歸耶和華為聖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作為土產初熟的果子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡吞吃它的必算為有罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"災禍必臨到他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列祖先的罪惡"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["雅各家、以色列家的各族啊，你們當聽耶和華的話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和華如此說：",{"text":"你們的列祖見我有甚麼不義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"竟遠離我，隨從虛無的神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自己成為虛妄的呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們也不說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那領我們從埃及地上來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"引導我們經過曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沙漠有深坑之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和乾旱死蔭、無人經過、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人居住之地的耶和華在哪裏呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我領你們進入肥美之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們得吃其中的果子和美物；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你們進入的時候就玷污我的地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我的產業成為可憎的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司都不說，耶和華在哪裏呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"傳講律法的都不認識我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"官長違背我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知藉巴力說預言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"隨從無益的神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝譴責他的子民"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：我因此必與你們爭辯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必與你們的子孫爭辯。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們且過到基提海島去察看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打發人往基達去留心查考，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看曾有這樣的事沒有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈有一國換了他的神嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其實這不是神！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我的百姓將他們的榮耀換了那無益的神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"諸天哪，要因此驚奇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"極其恐慌，甚為淒涼！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我的百姓做了兩件惡事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是離棄我這活水的泉源，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為自己鑿出池子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是破裂不能存水的池子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列不忠的結局"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"以色列是僕人嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是家中生的奴僕嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為何成為掠物呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少壯獅子向他咆哮，大聲吼叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他的地荒涼；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城邑也都焚燒，無人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挪弗人和答比匿人也打破你的頭頂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這事臨到你身上，不是你自招的嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不是因耶和華－你上帝引你行路的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你離棄他嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現今你為何在埃及路上要喝西曷的水呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為何在亞述路上要喝大河的水呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你自己的惡必懲治你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你背道的事必責備你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"由此可知可見，你離棄耶和華－你的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不存敬畏我的心，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃為惡事，為苦事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主－萬軍之耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列拒絕敬拜耶和華"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["我在古時折斷你的軛，解開你的繩索。",{"text":"你說：我必不事奉耶和華；","poem":1},"因為你在各高岡上、各青翠樹下屈身行淫",{"noteId":0},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"然而，我栽你是上等的葡萄樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全然是真種子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你怎麼向我變為外邦葡萄樹的壞枝子呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你雖用鹼、多用肥皂洗濯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你罪孽的痕跡仍然在我面前顯出。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你怎能說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我沒有玷污、沒有隨從眾巴力？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你看你谷中的路，就知道你所行的如何。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是快行的獨峰駝，狂奔亂走。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是野驢，慣在曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"慾心發動就吸風；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"起性的時候誰能使牠轉去呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡尋找牠的必不致疲乏；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在牠的月份必能尋見。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我說：你不要使腳上無鞋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喉嚨乾渴。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你倒說：這是枉然。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我喜愛別神，我必隨從他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列該受懲罰"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"text":"賊被捉拿，怎樣羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家和他們的君王、首領、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司、先知也都照樣羞愧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們向木頭說：你是我的父；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向石頭說：你是生我的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們以背向我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不以面向我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"及至遭遇患難的時候卻說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"起來拯救我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為自己做的神在哪裏呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你遭遇患難的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫他們起來拯救你吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大啊，你神的數目與你城的數目相等。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們為何與我爭辯呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們都違背了我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我責打你們的兒女是徒然的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們不受懲治。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們自己的刀吞滅你們的先知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像殘害的獅子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這世代的人哪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要看明耶和華的話。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我豈向以色列作曠野呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或作幽暗之地呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓為何說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們脫離約束，再不歸向你了？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"處女豈能忘記她的妝飾呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新婦豈能忘記她的美衣呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓卻忘記了我無數的日子！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"text":"你怎麼修飾你的道路要求愛情呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是惡劣的婦人你也叫她們行你的路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並且你的衣襟上有無辜窮人的血；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你殺他們並不是遇見他們挖窟窿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃是因這一切的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你還說：我無辜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的怒氣必定向我消了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，我必審問你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你自說：我沒有犯罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為何東跑西奔要更換你的路呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必因埃及蒙羞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像從前因亞述蒙羞一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你也必兩手抱頭從埃及出來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華已經棄絕你所倚靠的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必不因他們得順利。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：我在古時折斷你的軛，解開你的繩索，你就說：我必不事奉別神。誰知你在各高岡上、各青翠樹下仍屈身行淫","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":20}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":37}